      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与生野狄杜斯签订担当契约之后，\n那个誓言就一直留存心中――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c59d3cc7dda5fc5aea707befcd2e947a797fc85db3460a90767c863361286b08",
