    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0e726ecea7e13723b3ac7b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "确认！　真的没问题吗？\n你们的这份数据以及培养过的管理辅助AI，\n要广泛向大众公开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "118e202e35454fc25f3c0608b1ca7f71862f826a306dc6549bc4dc77678f5040",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1063/storytimeline_501063111.json",
